+ *   REVERB  Freeverb (Jezar's schroeder, public domain): 8 combs darkened by DAMP into 4 allpasses
+ *           per side, the right bank's lines 23 samples longer, and a pre-delay. Patch 0024: less
+ *           CPU and .pool than the Dattorro plate it replaces, same knobs (DECAY/DAMP/PRE/MIX).
  *
  * All of it single precision, no libm (fastmath.h). The buffers live in the device's .pool RAM.
  * fx_process() runs in the audio interrupt; fx_set() and fx_tempo() between blocks. */
